node_modules/
dist/
.env

# dist/ IS COMMITTED ON PURPOSE (2026-09-01). ~/.claude.json now runs
# `node ~/projects/plane-mcp/dist/index.js` directly instead of `npx -y
# @versedhand/plane-mcp`, because the npx cache was serving an Aug-13 tarball
# of 1.3.1 that did NOT contain the is_active assignee fix — so rebuilding dist
# changed nothing that executed, and every session kept assigning tickets to a
# disabled account. dist is now the RUNTIME, so a clone without it leaves the
# Plane MCP dead on a fresh machine.
!dist/
